Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Knowledge Base|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add KB Child Article As Draft
Priority: 3
	Given Page add
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Page|
	When SitePageNavigator goto Edit Page
		|page|Knowledge Base Page|
	And Page edit Page Layout Column
		|columnName|1 Column|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Knowledge Base Display|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Knowledge Base|
	And KBArticle add CP
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Parent Article Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Parent Article Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Page|
	And KBArticle add Child PG Via KB Display
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Child Article Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Child Article Title|
		|saveAsDraft|true|
	And Pause at locator '5000'
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Page|
	And KBArticle view PG
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Parent Article Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Parent Article Title|
	And AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'KnowledgeBase#HIERARCHY_NAVIGATION_CHILD'
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Knowledge Base|
	And KBArticle goto Child Article Descriptive Details
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Parent Article Title|
	Then KBArticle view CP
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Child Article Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Child Article Title|
		|kbStatus|Draft|
